WEBVTT

00:42.542 --> 00:45.962
SOLD OUT ON YOU

00:46.046 --> 00:50.049
I wanted to introduce the essence
in the best possible way,

00:50.133 --> 00:52.802
so I think we'll need a bit more time.

00:53.678 --> 00:56.473
-We'll have it perfectly ready for you.
-She must be crazy.

00:56.556 --> 01:00.060
So please think of today
as a session to get to know

01:00.143 --> 01:03.188
L'Étoile's La Fin Essence
a little bit more.

01:03.271 --> 01:04.272
TO STUDIO C

01:04.355 --> 01:07.567
Please ask any questions you may have
through the live chat.

01:09.069 --> 01:13.073
Everyone, let me remind you once more
that we will not be selling the product

01:13.156 --> 01:15.033
on tonight's broadcast.

01:15.116 --> 01:19.245
Put down your phones for a moment,
and please listen to my explanation.

01:20.538 --> 01:24.209
What surprised me the most
as I learned about La Fin Essence

01:24.292 --> 01:27.921
was the raw material
that makes up more than 90% of it.

01:28.588 --> 01:30.298
This white flower noori mushroom

01:30.381 --> 01:32.342
is a species native only to Korea,

01:32.425 --> 01:35.553
and it is cultivated exclusively
in Deokpung Village.

01:36.179 --> 01:39.098
Even a slight change in temperature
or humidity can make them spoil.

01:39.182 --> 01:41.935
Did she just blow a prime-time slot
worth millions per minute?

01:42.018 --> 01:44.729
So they're very delicate
and require meticulous care.

01:44.813 --> 01:46.397
To be honest, L'Étoile's La Fin Essence

01:46.481 --> 01:50.401
is such a well-known product
that needs no introduction from me.

01:50.485 --> 01:53.363
We're getting a lot of questions
about not being able to order.

01:53.905 --> 01:56.407
Again, please note
that we will not be selling the product

01:56.491 --> 01:58.076
on tonight's broadcast.

01:58.159 --> 02:00.829
Stop the broadcast now
and switch to a prerecorded segment!

02:02.539 --> 02:04.374
We'd like to thank you

02:04.457 --> 02:06.793
for taking the time
to listen to our introduction

02:06.876 --> 02:09.587
of L'Étoile's La Fin Essence.

02:09.671 --> 02:13.424
We'll be back with the next broadcast
as soon as possible.

02:13.508 --> 02:15.093
This has been Dam Ye-jin.

02:16.094 --> 02:17.220
HIT HOMESHOPPING

02:17.303 --> 02:19.139
Dam Ye-jin, you rotten brat.

02:19.222 --> 02:20.765
Have you lost your mind?

02:20.849 --> 02:22.225
Are you taking responsibility?

02:22.308 --> 02:24.269
How can you call yourself
a home shopping host?

02:28.314 --> 02:30.400
A home shopping host
does not spend a moment on air

02:30.483 --> 02:32.569
on anything else
besides selling the product.

02:32.652 --> 02:35.530
You went on TV
without knowing that basic rule?

02:35.613 --> 02:37.949
If it's a product that I can't trust 100%,

02:38.533 --> 02:40.118
I can't sell it to customers, Ms. Dong.

02:40.201 --> 02:41.995
Aren't you using them as an excuse?

02:43.496 --> 02:44.581
Get out.

02:44.664 --> 02:46.416
You don't have the right to stand here.

02:56.968 --> 02:58.136
I can't believe her.

02:58.219 --> 02:59.053
That little…

03:01.556 --> 03:03.558
This is ridiculous.

03:10.607 --> 03:11.608
Ms. Dam.

04:08.289 --> 04:09.415
You did a good job.

04:11.251 --> 04:12.627
Ms. Dam,

04:13.711 --> 04:15.380
you were really impressive tonight.

04:52.917 --> 04:54.961
Why did you come to HIT?

04:56.421 --> 04:58.381
You didn't even know how I'd react.

04:59.632 --> 05:02.010
Finding you was all I could think about.

05:03.177 --> 05:06.556
I was sure we'd be on the same page.

05:10.727 --> 05:11.561
You're saying…

05:12.729 --> 05:16.899
that you trusted me, right?

05:23.072 --> 05:25.450
Everyone will eventually realize

05:26.326 --> 05:28.369
that you made the right choice.

05:44.135 --> 05:46.054
But how did you know about this place?

05:46.763 --> 05:49.390
I come here sometimes
when I need some fresh air.

05:51.017 --> 05:53.186
I mentioned this place
during a recent live I did.

05:53.269 --> 05:54.771
Did you watch it?

05:57.982 --> 05:59.067
No.

06:01.778 --> 06:03.571
I was just joking.

06:04.072 --> 06:06.532
I guess I'm saying nonsense
because I can't think straight.

06:09.327 --> 06:10.286
Are you all right?

06:14.207 --> 06:16.000
Thank you for tonight.

06:17.126 --> 06:20.463
In return, I promise
to have your back too one day.

06:20.546 --> 06:22.006
You can count on me.

07:04.465 --> 07:07.218
-Mr. Seo.
-Did you know about this?

07:07.301 --> 07:09.178
Sir? What do you mean?

07:10.096 --> 07:11.764
MICROBIAL TESTING AND EXPECTED RESULTS

07:11.848 --> 07:14.350
These numbers
are much lower than the limit.

07:15.184 --> 07:16.477
This is within the normal range.

07:16.561 --> 07:18.521
Normal? When the growth rate is that high?

07:18.604 --> 07:20.731
Are you sure there were no issues
during production?

07:20.815 --> 07:25.319
Mr. Seo, there are microorganisms
floating around the air around us.

07:25.403 --> 07:28.781
The point is not to exceed the limit,
and as you know,

07:28.865 --> 07:32.285
our essence contains preservatives
to prevent that.

07:32.368 --> 07:34.871
It passed even the strict EU standards

07:34.954 --> 07:36.456
without any issues.

07:37.290 --> 07:38.958
You know that better than anyone.

07:39.041 --> 07:42.003
For now,
suspend all production this minute.

07:58.519 --> 07:59.353
Hello?

07:59.437 --> 08:00.396
Eric!

08:00.480 --> 08:02.440
What happened to the launch broadcast?

08:02.523 --> 08:05.735
And that showcase? What on earth was that?

08:07.653 --> 08:09.864
I'm asking you what happened!

08:09.947 --> 08:10.865
I'm looking into it.

08:10.948 --> 08:12.492
"Looking into it"?

08:13.659 --> 08:17.246
So you're saying that host did this
without even discussing it with you?

08:17.330 --> 08:18.498
I see.

08:18.581 --> 08:20.958
Michelle, don't touch her.

08:22.168 --> 08:24.545
-What?
-Don't lay a hand

08:25.671 --> 08:27.298
on Dam Ye-jin.

08:36.599 --> 08:40.853
SOMETHING'S UP IF IT WAS SUDDENLY PULLED
DOES THE ESSENCE HAVE PROBLEMS? TELL US!

08:40.937 --> 08:42.939
AS ALWAYS, PASS ON COSMETICS
SOLD BY DAM YE-JIN

08:50.655 --> 08:52.448
HIT HOMESHOPPING

09:02.708 --> 09:04.669
How will the broadcast proceed now?

09:07.046 --> 09:08.798
You mean the follow-up broadcast?

09:08.881 --> 09:11.050
Right, yes…

09:11.634 --> 09:13.052
We should get it ready quickly!

09:13.135 --> 09:14.637
With the original contract terms,

09:14.720 --> 09:16.514
we'll schedule it
for two consecutive days.

09:16.597 --> 09:18.224
We'll adjust the commission fee as well.

09:18.307 --> 09:19.267
The commission fee too?

09:19.350 --> 09:20.601
Of course, sir.

09:20.685 --> 09:22.979
It was the result of a mistake on our end.

09:23.062 --> 09:24.939
Geez, that Dam Ye-jin.

09:25.439 --> 09:28.734
That oddball was already
seen as a liability,

09:28.818 --> 09:30.736
and she ended up causing a huge mess.

09:31.445 --> 09:33.698
Once again, we sincerely apologize.

09:33.781 --> 09:36.242
-In the follow-up broadcast--
-Before that,

09:36.325 --> 09:38.619
we'd like to run another product test.

09:39.412 --> 09:40.621
Would that be all right?

09:42.164 --> 09:43.624
For what?

09:43.708 --> 09:45.960
Dam Ye-jin was called an oddball

09:46.043 --> 09:49.505
because she's different
from the other hosts who simply memorize

09:49.589 --> 09:51.674
and recite what our clients
want them to say.

09:52.300 --> 09:53.759
What if we rush the broadcast

09:54.802 --> 09:56.262
and something truly goes wrong?

09:57.680 --> 09:58.681
All right, then.

09:59.473 --> 10:00.808
I would like to check as well.

10:09.859 --> 10:10.693
Look at this.

10:12.153 --> 10:16.824
These fools at L'Étoile must have decided
to just deny everything for now.

10:16.907 --> 10:19.910
It seems Dam Ye-jin's going to
end up taking all the blame.

10:21.621 --> 10:23.873
L'Étoile has issued a statement today

10:23.956 --> 10:27.627
on their official website
regarding quality concerns

10:27.710 --> 10:31.631
of their product from a launch broadcast
that are spreading across social media.

10:32.256 --> 10:35.593
According to the statement,
the broadcast was switched to a showcase

10:35.676 --> 10:39.096
based solely on the host's decision,

10:39.180 --> 10:43.809
and it claims there were
no functional issues with the product.

10:43.893 --> 10:47.813
This has sparked a flood of criticism
that the broadcast's host, Dam Ye-jin,

10:47.897 --> 10:49.607
may have intervened excessively.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.734
Past partner companies
have been stepping forward

10:51.817 --> 10:53.319
with similar allegations.

11:01.661 --> 11:03.746
She checked our samples ten times.

11:03.829 --> 11:05.748
But then, she nitpicked something trivial

11:05.831 --> 11:07.333
and eventually rejected our product.

11:07.416 --> 11:11.545
We even gave up a department store launch
because she'd said she would sell them.

11:13.214 --> 11:15.007
That's ridiculous…

11:20.888 --> 11:22.765
MY DEAR DAUGHTER

11:25.393 --> 11:27.353
The person you are calling is unavailable…

11:40.908 --> 11:43.160
MYEONG-HWA

11:59.760 --> 12:01.554
DAM YE-JIN

12:24.618 --> 12:25.911
Mr. Park.

12:29.415 --> 12:31.333
What brings you here at this hour?

12:31.417 --> 12:32.835
I'm sorry to bother you so late.

12:32.918 --> 12:34.670
Could I borrow your phone?

12:34.753 --> 12:35.754
My phone?

12:36.464 --> 12:38.007
Why? Is yours broken?

12:38.090 --> 12:40.718
If it was,
I guess you couldn't have called me.

13:24.637 --> 13:26.055
WE'D LIKE TO REQUEST AN INTERVIEW

13:26.138 --> 13:27.932
I TRUSTED YOU AND BOUGHT SO MANY PRODUCTS

13:28.015 --> 13:29.350
TYPICAL ONLINE SELLER

13:50.996 --> 13:52.581
MR. MECHOORI

13:56.752 --> 13:57.628
Hello?

13:58.420 --> 13:59.588
Mr. Mechoori?

13:59.672 --> 14:00.756
Yes.

14:02.049 --> 14:03.592
Has it exceeded the CFU limit?

14:05.344 --> 14:07.096
No, not yet.

14:07.805 --> 14:09.139
Then, why did you call me?

14:13.269 --> 14:15.271
Wear your socks to bed.

14:16.146 --> 14:16.981
What?

14:17.064 --> 14:18.274
I mean…

14:19.817 --> 14:21.402
I read a study somewhere

14:21.485 --> 14:24.280
that wearing socks to bed
dilates peripheral blood vessels,

14:24.363 --> 14:25.781
helping with temperature regulation

14:25.865 --> 14:27.616
and better sleep.

14:33.497 --> 14:36.709
Did you call me at this hour
to tell me that?

14:37.585 --> 14:39.461
No, it's not that…

14:39.545 --> 14:41.839
I know why you called.

14:42.756 --> 14:43.799
What?

14:44.425 --> 14:47.052
You suddenly called me
and started rambling.

14:50.389 --> 14:51.307
You're drunk, right?

14:54.393 --> 14:55.311
No.

14:55.895 --> 14:57.062
-I didn't drink--
-I'm joking.

14:58.272 --> 15:00.482
I'm sure you have a lot on your mind too.

15:01.275 --> 15:02.359
It's late.

15:03.235 --> 15:04.486
You should go and sleep.

15:07.531 --> 15:08.532
Okay.

15:41.523 --> 15:42.775
L'Étoile's headquarters

15:42.858 --> 15:46.153
distanced themselves from Dam Ye-jin
and said she acted on her own.

15:46.946 --> 15:48.572
Do you see it the same way?

15:48.656 --> 15:51.492
We're still looking into the matter,

15:51.575 --> 15:53.911
but we can't conclude
it was L'Étoile's fault yet.

15:53.994 --> 15:57.915
The numbers from today
were still less than half the limit.

15:58.540 --> 15:59.959
Weren't you being too rash?

16:00.042 --> 16:03.128
The decision that day
and this discussion today.

16:03.837 --> 16:05.339
Right now, Dam Ye-jin is--

16:05.422 --> 16:06.715
Ms. Dam…

16:07.675 --> 16:09.677
will do a follow-up broadcast

16:09.760 --> 16:10.594
with L'Étoile.

16:10.678 --> 16:12.221
Do you think Ms. Dam

16:13.555 --> 16:15.307
will be all right until then?

16:23.065 --> 16:27.361
HIT
WE SELL VALUE WITH SINCERITY

16:29.655 --> 16:34.410
I made the judgment that our trust
with customers came before sales.

16:36.787 --> 16:39.248
Even if I were to go back
to before the broadcast,

16:39.331 --> 16:41.125
I would make the same choice.

16:41.208 --> 16:44.253
I'll take responsibility
for all the consequences of my decision.

16:44.336 --> 16:45.546
"Responsibility"?

16:45.629 --> 16:47.172
How will you take responsibility?

16:48.090 --> 16:49.091
This L'Étoile launch

16:49.174 --> 16:52.094
had 1.5 billion won in sales
and a 100 million-won clause riding on it.

16:52.177 --> 16:53.095
Could you handle that?

16:53.178 --> 16:55.014
Do you know that HIT's website

16:55.097 --> 16:58.851
has been flooded with posts from people
saying they'll file official complaints

16:58.934 --> 17:00.310
for consumer deception?

17:00.394 --> 17:02.396
Our customers
had eagerly awaited the launch.

17:02.479 --> 17:04.606
How will you make up
for breaking their trust?

17:04.690 --> 17:07.985
Given the microbial growth rate,
it was bound to become an issue.

17:08.068 --> 17:08.944
Power tripping.

17:09.820 --> 17:12.906
Canceling a broadcast by nitpicking
a perfectly normal product

17:12.990 --> 17:14.742
is what we call power tripping.

17:14.825 --> 17:15.909
It's because of you!

17:15.993 --> 17:19.246
You made it seem like we abused our power,
and HIT's in this huge mess now!

17:19.329 --> 17:21.373
You ran your mouth
without even knowing anything.

17:22.082 --> 17:23.500
Director Dong Hyun-ki,

17:23.584 --> 17:25.753
there's no need to hear anything more.

17:29.840 --> 17:30.841
Ms. Dam Ye-jin.

17:36.180 --> 17:38.766
Due to a breach of our contract terms,

17:39.933 --> 17:41.643
effective today,

17:42.227 --> 17:44.480
HIT will be terminating
its contract with you.

17:53.489 --> 17:57.659
"We sell value with sincerity."

18:00.913 --> 18:02.039
I…

18:03.457 --> 18:06.668
made the choice
to keep the promise that HIT made.

18:07.377 --> 18:09.171
You'll soon realize that my choice…

18:11.131 --> 18:13.008
wasn't wrong.

18:17.596 --> 18:18.430
That little…

18:18.514 --> 18:20.265
-What is she so proud of?
-What did she say?

18:20.349 --> 18:21.642
The nerve of her!

18:21.725 --> 18:23.685
-Are you going to let this slide?
-She's so smug.

18:24.186 --> 18:25.938
How can she be so shameless?

18:27.606 --> 18:29.066
-I'll carry it--
-It's fine.

18:29.149 --> 18:30.984
You're really going to leave like this?

18:31.068 --> 18:33.904
Holding out here won't get me any shows.

18:33.987 --> 18:36.949
Ms. Dam, why don't you just go
and speak to Ms. Dong…

18:37.032 --> 18:39.368
Come on, what's with you?
This isn't the end.

18:39.451 --> 18:41.411
I'm Dam Ye-jin, you know.

18:41.495 --> 18:44.623
This is just a tactical retreat for now.
I'll be back soon.

18:45.833 --> 18:48.752
So get back to work.
Don't slack off because of my absence.

18:49.586 --> 18:51.421
We'll call you.

18:51.505 --> 18:52.673
You better pick up.

18:52.756 --> 18:54.299
Don't try my patience!

18:54.383 --> 18:56.844
Geez, I should block the both of you.

18:59.638 --> 19:01.849
Are you really going to
just take the meds again?

19:05.102 --> 19:06.270
Ms. Dam.

19:07.020 --> 19:09.898
What are you going to do
if this leads to sleepwalking?

19:10.941 --> 19:14.111
It may seem like nothing
is helping at the moment,

19:14.194 --> 19:15.779
but one by one, if you try to resolve--

19:15.863 --> 19:16.780
I…

19:18.657 --> 19:20.742
I'm completely fine,

19:21.451 --> 19:22.411
Doctor.

19:23.537 --> 19:25.205
Isn't that just what you want to believe?

19:45.017 --> 19:46.977
Let's talk inside.

20:13.295 --> 20:15.339
MAKE SURE TO TAKE PROBIOTICS
AND DON'T SKIP MEALS

20:20.093 --> 20:21.845
STIR-FRIED SQUID, BRAISED TOFU
DOENJANG STEW

20:39.279 --> 20:41.198
You really are a great actress.

20:41.782 --> 20:43.909
People might think you're actually my mom.

20:49.331 --> 20:50.582
Stop being so grumpy.

20:52.292 --> 20:54.336
I'm not here to talk about that.

20:55.128 --> 20:58.507
You must have rushed over in excitement
after hearing I got fired.

20:58.590 --> 21:00.384
Show's over now, so leave.

21:05.013 --> 21:07.683
Can't you even manage
your health properly?

21:08.934 --> 21:10.644
Just get to the point.

21:14.481 --> 21:17.734
Don't even set foot
near the cosmetics industry again.

21:18.652 --> 21:20.404
That's what I came to say.

21:22.364 --> 21:24.741
You came all the way here

21:25.617 --> 21:26.618
just to say that?

21:28.036 --> 21:29.705
You should've stopped when I told you to.

21:30.622 --> 21:31.623
Look!

21:31.707 --> 21:32.874
You couldn't even handle it--

21:32.958 --> 21:34.251
And ran away?

21:35.794 --> 21:36.837
Running away

21:37.838 --> 21:40.549
is what you did when you abandoned
your young child,

21:42.718 --> 21:44.303
Ms. Song Myeong-hwa.

22:24.551 --> 22:29.306
MICROBIAL TEST RESULTS

22:41.068 --> 22:42.444
How do the numbers look?

22:48.784 --> 22:51.078
You look so pale.

22:51.161 --> 22:53.121
Are you okay? Is something wrong?

22:53.205 --> 22:54.539
No, it's nothing.

23:04.591 --> 23:06.718
I, Kang Mu-won, can no longer allow this.

23:08.095 --> 23:09.179
Let's go, baby.

23:12.140 --> 23:13.141
-Mu-won.
-Yeah?

23:13.225 --> 23:14.601
I'm busy.

23:14.684 --> 23:17.062
Me too. But this will only take a moment.

23:17.145 --> 23:19.272
Come on. Geez.

23:24.820 --> 23:26.321
Hey, Hae-seok.

23:27.572 --> 23:31.034
Can't you just tell me now?

23:31.785 --> 23:33.954
Why are you so obsessed with the numbers?

23:37.624 --> 23:39.417
It's because this is the only way

23:40.377 --> 23:41.461
I can help Ms. Dam.

23:47.425 --> 23:48.426
Is this…

23:50.053 --> 23:51.721
because of what happened back then?

23:55.267 --> 23:58.520
I told you a million times
to put that in the past.

23:58.603 --> 23:59.980
It was all because of Choi Woo-su.

24:00.063 --> 24:03.233
He deliberately planned all that,
and you were just the victim.

24:03.316 --> 24:05.193
-You didn't have a choice--
-Mu-won!

24:07.487 --> 24:09.197
Let's not talk about that.

24:21.376 --> 24:25.547
We're almost sold out.
About 400 orders have come in all at once,

24:25.630 --> 24:27.424
and all the customer service agents
are busy.

24:28.091 --> 24:29.176
The queue is full.

24:29.259 --> 24:32.762
Seriously. Thank you all so much.

24:32.846 --> 24:33.930
My goodness.

24:34.014 --> 24:37.642
People who know this product well

24:37.726 --> 24:39.269
are busy stockpiling them.

24:40.145 --> 24:43.982
This lipstick is the top product
in Europe, and it went viral in Paris.

24:44.065 --> 24:48.445
Ta-da! Everyone knows this lipstick.

24:48.528 --> 24:49.946
You know,

24:51.198 --> 24:55.619
I had such a really hard time
getting enough stock for all of you.

24:55.702 --> 24:57.537
You can buy these

24:57.621 --> 25:03.210
only tonight on The Ji Yun-ji Show.

25:03.293 --> 25:05.754
You have no idea how lucky you are.

25:05.837 --> 25:08.632
Viewer 8739 says, "Yun-ji,
can you show us the Modern Red color?"

25:08.715 --> 25:10.884
I was just about to show you this one.

25:10.967 --> 25:12.385
It's cute, right?

25:12.886 --> 25:18.058
The color payoff is excellent,
and it applies so smoothly.

25:28.526 --> 25:30.111
DAM YE-JIN

25:40.872 --> 25:42.666
Mom.

25:42.749 --> 25:44.751
Ms. Dam, where are you?

25:47.837 --> 25:50.465
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

25:52.050 --> 25:53.343
I'm…

25:54.344 --> 25:56.805
-on my way to do the broadcast.
-Ms. Dam…

25:58.682 --> 26:00.809
Sir, could you take me
to HIT Homeshopping?

26:00.892 --> 26:02.352
Please hurry.

26:03.270 --> 26:04.271
Ms. Dam.

26:06.022 --> 26:07.607
Ms. Dam!

26:18.535 --> 26:19.786
Mom…

26:24.582 --> 26:27.627
Ms. Dam! Where are you right now?

26:33.800 --> 26:35.176
Ms. Dam!

26:42.517 --> 26:43.560
Mom.

26:47.272 --> 26:48.398
I'm…

26:51.484 --> 26:53.361
not going to run away.

26:54.571 --> 26:56.906
SONG MYEONG-HWA COMPACT
ONLY AT HIT HOMESHOPPING

27:06.249 --> 27:07.250
Ms. Dam!

27:12.714 --> 27:14.174
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

27:15.050 --> 27:16.092
Ms. Dam!

27:40.909 --> 27:43.370
Ms. Dam, are you okay?

27:49.542 --> 27:50.377
Let's go.

27:51.002 --> 27:51.961
Mechoori…

27:55.131 --> 27:56.257
Mr. Mechoori.

27:58.593 --> 28:00.303
This is a secret.

28:05.809 --> 28:07.977
She's my mom.

28:09.687 --> 28:10.855
My mom.

28:18.530 --> 28:20.990
Ms. Dam, let's--

28:21.074 --> 28:23.243
I have to go and do the broadcast.

28:24.577 --> 28:27.247
I prepared so hard for this.

29:34.147 --> 29:35.565
Let's go.

30:34.082 --> 30:35.416
MUST TAKE ONLY ONE PACK PER DAY

30:36.334 --> 30:37.168
It's cute, right?

30:37.877 --> 30:40.713
I'm completely fine, Doctor.

30:41.381 --> 30:43.633
Isn't that just what you want to believe?

30:58.940 --> 31:01.818
Sit down. We need to talk.

31:04.737 --> 31:08.241
I'm not feeling well, so I need to rest.

31:09.826 --> 31:12.370
You need to hear this.

31:14.914 --> 31:16.165
Next time.

31:22.213 --> 31:23.631
You don't remember

31:24.340 --> 31:25.425
anything from last night?

31:25.508 --> 31:27.677
Didn't you hear me? I want to rest.

31:27.760 --> 31:29.053
Did you take…

31:29.762 --> 31:31.389
Did you take those pills all at once?

31:37.437 --> 31:38.688
What does it matter to you?

31:38.771 --> 31:39.856
Ms. Dam!

31:39.939 --> 31:41.941
I told you to just leave!

31:45.194 --> 31:49.490
Do you really need to tell me
that I've hit rock bottom?

31:51.993 --> 31:54.245
I already know. You don't have to tell me.

31:54.329 --> 31:57.874
I know I'm a complete mess!

31:59.417 --> 32:03.338
But all I can do right now
is to pretend that I'm okay!

32:04.172 --> 32:06.674
Why won't you let me even do that?

32:21.439 --> 32:22.565
What…

32:23.524 --> 32:26.861
What if this really is the end for me?

32:40.291 --> 32:42.335
What do I do?

32:50.218 --> 32:52.804
DAM YE-JIN

33:03.690 --> 33:04.524
Hello?

33:04.607 --> 33:08.736
HIT is asking us to send
the QA documents again. What's going on?

33:08.820 --> 33:12.699
They should be paying us a penalty fee,
but they want a re-inspection?

33:12.782 --> 33:16.285
We've already agreed
to do a follow-up broadcast with HIT.

33:16.369 --> 33:17.745
Eric!

33:17.829 --> 33:19.747
Are you out of your mind?

33:19.831 --> 33:22.041
I guess I must be far from home.

33:22.125 --> 33:24.794
Ever since I got here,
I've really felt the distance between us.

33:27.088 --> 33:29.007
-Don't change the subject.
-Michelle.

33:29.841 --> 33:31.592
-Are you feeling anxious?
-What?

33:31.676 --> 33:33.678
You were always kind and generous to me.

33:35.388 --> 33:37.724
But whenever you'd suddenly
shout at me like this,

33:38.808 --> 33:40.393
I would think,

33:42.270 --> 33:44.397
"I'm just a piece of gum she's chewing."

33:48.693 --> 33:51.446
A piece of gum you chew on
to relieve your stress…

33:54.240 --> 33:55.366
when you're nervous.

33:57.493 --> 34:02.540
But I still wanted to be
someone that you needed.

34:03.833 --> 34:05.293
So…

34:08.254 --> 34:10.131
don't spit me out so rashly.

34:13.217 --> 34:16.679
I don't want to stick to the bottom
of your soles and cause you trouble.

34:41.412 --> 34:44.707
Do you regret
stopping the broadcast that day?

34:47.543 --> 34:48.628
No.

34:48.711 --> 34:50.505
Then, you should be doing well.

34:50.588 --> 34:52.048
Why are you such a mess?

35:00.598 --> 35:01.849
Pack your stuff and come out.

35:03.309 --> 35:05.603
Can't you just leave me be?

35:07.730 --> 35:10.108
Come with me. Please.

35:15.321 --> 35:17.490
Where are we going?

35:25.832 --> 35:26.666
Hey, there!

35:27.750 --> 35:30.002
Come on in. Take a seat.

35:35.091 --> 35:36.175
Right!

35:36.259 --> 35:40.346
I stir-fried sweet potato stems for you,
but I forgot.

35:40.429 --> 35:41.305
Stay here, ma'am.

35:41.389 --> 35:42.390
I'll go get them.

35:47.353 --> 35:50.273
She looks so gaunt now.

35:51.274 --> 35:54.277
What else should I feed her?

35:54.360 --> 35:55.903
What does sweetie like?

35:57.530 --> 35:58.531
I don't know either.

35:59.407 --> 36:02.702
Geez. You have the looks but nothing else.

36:08.082 --> 36:09.000
What was that?

36:11.460 --> 36:12.753
Ms. Dam!

36:12.837 --> 36:14.213
Sweetie!

36:23.681 --> 36:26.142
What's wrong? Is she badly ill?

36:26.225 --> 36:27.476
She's malnourished

36:27.560 --> 36:29.061
and very dehydrated.

36:29.145 --> 36:32.315
It seems she's been really worn out.

36:32.398 --> 36:34.275
She even has insomnia,

36:34.358 --> 36:36.861
so her body's pressed on the brakes

36:36.944 --> 36:38.237
because it wants some rest.

36:38.321 --> 36:41.032
Then, will she be okay
if she gets enough rest?

36:41.616 --> 36:43.492
Yes, with plenty of rest.

36:43.576 --> 36:45.286
Gosh, what a relief.

36:45.369 --> 36:47.788
I'm so relieved.

36:47.872 --> 36:50.416
At least it wasn't anything worse.

36:52.793 --> 36:54.712
WOORI DEOKPUNG MEDICAL CLINIC

36:59.091 --> 37:00.426
She's awake.

37:00.509 --> 37:02.011
-She's awake!
-She's awake!

37:03.721 --> 37:04.680
She's awake!

37:04.764 --> 37:05.598
She's up!

37:07.141 --> 37:08.059
My goodness!

37:08.851 --> 37:10.019
Are you all right?

37:10.102 --> 37:11.103
Yes.

37:11.896 --> 37:12.980
I…

37:16.275 --> 37:17.443
Jung-muk!

37:17.526 --> 37:19.153
Ms. Dam is awake!

37:19.237 --> 37:20.613
Should she go to a big hospital?

37:20.696 --> 37:22.406
Is it serious? What do we do?

37:23.449 --> 37:24.450
She needs rest.

37:24.533 --> 37:25.409
Come here.

37:26.535 --> 37:27.370
She needs rest.

37:27.453 --> 37:28.663
How are you feeling?

37:31.582 --> 37:33.084
What's wrong?

37:35.419 --> 37:36.545
I'm hungry.

37:38.464 --> 37:39.757
Goodness!

37:40.466 --> 37:42.426
You should eat then.

37:51.477 --> 37:53.229
It's about that time when you get hungry.

37:55.982 --> 37:57.817
-Yeah?
-We should have a feast.

37:57.900 --> 38:00.027
It is about that time. Right?

38:00.861 --> 38:02.613
You understand, right?

38:02.697 --> 38:03.698
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am.

38:03.781 --> 38:05.157
Let's do it right.

38:05.241 --> 38:07.326
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am. Don't worry.

38:11.163 --> 38:14.375
Ma'am, let me make dinner
for you this evening.

38:14.458 --> 38:16.585
Oh, dear.

38:16.669 --> 38:21.382
I totally forgot that my youngest daughter
and her husband are visiting tonight.

38:21.465 --> 38:23.926
-Goodness.
-Really?

38:24.010 --> 38:25.052
That's too bad.

38:25.928 --> 38:27.305
Our daughter's old room--

38:30.599 --> 38:32.268
It's gone. It's all broken down.

38:33.978 --> 38:35.229
Then, by any chance…

38:36.355 --> 38:38.357
Our house is a huge mess.

38:38.441 --> 38:40.735
Gosh, don't say it like that.

38:40.818 --> 38:43.988
We have a lot of rescue dogs at home.

38:44.071 --> 38:45.990
-Right.
-Woof, woof.

38:46.073 --> 38:47.158
Then, what should I do?

38:47.241 --> 38:51.746
Since this is the countryside,
there aren't any lodgings here.

38:51.829 --> 38:55.333
Is that the only place left?

38:55.416 --> 38:57.126
-Oh, right.
-Right?

38:57.209 --> 38:58.586
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

38:58.669 --> 38:59.670
-That's right.
-Where?

38:59.754 --> 39:01.756
For goodness' sake.

39:01.839 --> 39:04.133
You still haven't caught on?

39:04.216 --> 39:06.302
This is all a setup.

39:07.762 --> 39:08.596
What?

39:08.679 --> 39:11.807
The choice had already been made for you.

39:27.531 --> 39:28.991
What?

39:37.625 --> 39:39.377
-Ms. Dam.
-Yes?

39:41.170 --> 39:43.047
I only brought you to my home

39:43.130 --> 39:47.009
to take responsibility for being partly
the cause of your current condition.

39:48.260 --> 39:51.013
So while you're here,
please do things my way.

39:52.723 --> 39:54.183
What exactly is "your way"?

39:55.726 --> 39:57.228
You'll find out soon enough.

39:58.813 --> 39:59.897
Let's head inside.

40:01.482 --> 40:02.483
Okay.

40:09.698 --> 40:11.200
-Watch your step.
-Right.

40:19.542 --> 40:21.919
Okay, I'll go and unpack first.

40:22.503 --> 40:24.922
I just realized you don't have
any spare rooms.

40:25.005 --> 40:26.006
Then, how…

40:26.715 --> 40:28.968
That room! I'll stay there.

40:29.552 --> 40:30.678
That's the bathroom.

40:31.971 --> 40:34.181
I see. It's the bathroom.

40:35.850 --> 40:37.143
Then, where…

40:38.519 --> 40:42.064
That's a room, right? I'll go stay there.

40:45.609 --> 40:48.487
Gosh, it's nice and spacious.

40:49.822 --> 40:50.656
Ms. Dam.

40:51.532 --> 40:52.533
Yes?

40:52.616 --> 40:53.576
Please come here.

40:54.410 --> 40:55.744
Okay.

41:01.292 --> 41:02.293
Can you come over here?

41:04.378 --> 41:06.005
To… To the bed?

41:07.256 --> 41:09.633
It's okay. I can rest in that room.

41:09.717 --> 41:11.260
What? Why?

41:22.021 --> 41:24.231
I'm sure you're sleepy by now.

41:24.315 --> 41:25.441
But there's no bed in there.

41:25.524 --> 41:27.318
It'll be uncomfortable
sleeping on the floor,

41:27.401 --> 41:28.652
and you won't be able to sleep.

41:28.736 --> 41:29.612
So just sleep here.

41:33.991 --> 41:36.410
No, it's fine.
I'll only be staying for a little while.

41:36.494 --> 41:37.703
You can use the bed.

41:38.454 --> 41:39.497
It's no big deal.

42:00.893 --> 42:04.313
By the way,
I just realized there's no TV here either.

42:04.396 --> 42:05.231
I don't have a TV.

42:05.314 --> 42:08.567
-How can you not have a TV?
-I hate things that are loud.

42:08.651 --> 42:11.695
You can just lower the volume then.

42:11.779 --> 42:14.865
So do you always live
like you're in some kind of retreat?

42:15.533 --> 42:16.534
Don't you get bored?

42:18.702 --> 42:19.703
Aren't you going to eat?

42:21.413 --> 42:22.414
I am eating.

42:25.000 --> 42:27.586
-So you don't use your phone often either?
-I don't.

42:30.673 --> 42:31.674
I see.

42:33.801 --> 42:36.428
I guess there are some positives
of being unemployed.

42:36.512 --> 42:39.682
I get to take walks in a place like this
with nice scenery and fresh air.

42:41.183 --> 42:42.601
I feel much better now.

42:45.521 --> 42:49.358
By the way,
where did you see me last night?

42:53.279 --> 42:56.282
I was passing by
and spotted you by chance around HIT.

42:56.365 --> 42:57.491
HIT?

43:00.411 --> 43:03.289
But I didn't say anything weird, did I?

43:03.372 --> 43:04.707
No.

43:09.753 --> 43:10.963
I guess I'm getting punished.

43:12.339 --> 43:15.634
The first thing I did
when I became a main host

43:16.218 --> 43:17.761
was cut down on sleep.

43:19.638 --> 43:21.223
"Just ten more minutes."

43:21.307 --> 43:24.018
I'd say, "Let's practice
for just ten more minutes."

43:25.436 --> 43:27.813
I thought that once I settled down
and got used to the job,

43:27.896 --> 43:30.649
I'd be able to sleep well like before.

43:31.984 --> 43:33.819
But I ignored the fact

43:33.902 --> 43:36.322
that the body falls into a routine.

43:38.574 --> 43:41.869
It seems my body is pretty upset with me.

43:41.952 --> 43:46.415
But I don't know
how to make it feel better.

43:47.249 --> 43:50.502
You've already achieved a lot
by realizing that.

43:51.795 --> 43:53.255
How would you know that?

43:56.008 --> 43:58.260
I once used to be unable to sleep
without meds too.

43:58.344 --> 43:59.345
You too?

44:01.055 --> 44:03.182
But I can sleep well without them now.

44:03.265 --> 44:05.726
How? Tell me your secret.
I want to get better too--

44:05.809 --> 44:06.685
Ms. Dam.

44:08.812 --> 44:10.397
You told me once

44:11.148 --> 44:14.443
that if you spill milk,
you can wipe it up and dry the towel.

44:16.070 --> 44:17.946
We get much more sunlight here
than in Seoul,

44:19.657 --> 44:23.035
so just stay here and relax
instead of straining yourself.

44:23.952 --> 44:26.580
I'm sure that's what
your body wants the most.

44:52.106 --> 44:55.943
Ms. Michelle wanted me to give you this.

45:10.416 --> 45:11.250
She…

45:12.835 --> 45:14.336
wants me to come back?

45:17.047 --> 45:20.926
I was told it was the chairman's orders.

45:24.513 --> 45:26.181
Did she tell you

45:27.099 --> 45:28.559
to say that?

45:35.649 --> 45:37.484
I'm only joking.

45:39.945 --> 45:41.238
I must be drunk.

45:41.738 --> 45:42.698
I should stop drinking.

45:45.159 --> 45:49.663
I'll stop by the production plant then
and head home afterwards.

45:59.965 --> 46:01.216
Joong-hoon…

46:10.017 --> 46:11.393
Because of me,

46:13.061 --> 46:14.646
you've had to put up with a lot.

46:18.442 --> 46:19.776
I'm sorry.

46:47.137 --> 46:48.805
What are you doing?

46:58.148 --> 46:58.982
What?

46:59.066 --> 47:00.150
What is this?

47:00.234 --> 47:01.318
DAM YE-JIN'S DAILY SCHEDULE

47:01.401 --> 47:04.488
This is your daily schedule for the week.

47:05.614 --> 47:06.782
Oh, come on.

47:06.865 --> 47:09.201
I'm not some grade schooler
on summer vacation.

47:09.284 --> 47:11.495
You told me last night
to relax and not strain myself.

47:11.578 --> 47:13.163
You need to put in effort to rest well.

47:13.247 --> 47:16.083
-I've tried all these before.
-Doing them daily will be different.

47:20.337 --> 47:21.421
But…

47:23.423 --> 47:25.467
6:00 A.M. WAKE UP AND STRETCH
6:30 A.M. MORNING RUN

47:31.181 --> 47:32.432
Go on ahead!

47:33.475 --> 47:34.643
I need a breather.

47:35.352 --> 47:37.145
Just for a bit…

47:41.608 --> 47:42.943
COME ON NOW

47:51.159 --> 47:52.119
Yes?

47:54.580 --> 47:55.664
-Are you busy?
-No.

47:55.747 --> 47:56.873
Come out for a second.

47:59.209 --> 48:01.670
I've been using
a cervical pillow for a while,

48:01.753 --> 48:03.380
and it helps me sleep really well.

48:03.463 --> 48:04.339
Really?

48:04.423 --> 48:05.382
Try it out.

48:08.844 --> 48:09.678
Goodness.

48:13.390 --> 48:14.975
Hey, it's nice.

48:17.477 --> 48:18.895
I'll order one then.

48:28.572 --> 48:29.781
What is all this?

48:33.535 --> 48:34.369
They're so pretty.

48:50.093 --> 48:53.096
The subtle scent of lavender
will calm your mind

48:53.180 --> 48:55.557
and help you fall asleep.

49:07.027 --> 49:08.278
LAVENDER ICE CREAM

49:10.614 --> 49:14.076
So they even sell lavender ice cream.

49:14.159 --> 49:15.160
Thanks.

49:18.413 --> 49:19.414
It's pretty good.

49:25.671 --> 49:27.297
Let's go.

50:08.755 --> 50:10.590
It's decaf!

50:12.676 --> 50:13.719
It's hot.

50:18.807 --> 50:20.183
I should have drunk it right away.

51:04.936 --> 51:07.063
It's a frequency that helps with sleep.

51:09.065 --> 51:09.941
What?

51:10.025 --> 51:11.651
It's a frequency that helps with sleep.

51:45.018 --> 51:45.936
I'm so thirsty.

51:56.404 --> 51:57.614
Geez, that startled me.

52:11.837 --> 52:14.214
What's he doing at this hour?

52:37.445 --> 52:38.363
What on earth?

52:43.618 --> 52:45.412
Ouch.

52:51.918 --> 52:53.670
That must hurt.

52:55.088 --> 52:56.423
What on earth is he doing?

53:01.303 --> 53:02.429
A saw?

53:17.319 --> 53:18.320
Oh, my gosh.

53:36.379 --> 53:39.466
He really is a strange person.

53:51.686 --> 53:54.272
-Don't forget to breathe.
-This is killing me.

53:56.858 --> 53:59.152
-Ma'am!
-Ms. Dam.

53:59.778 --> 54:01.237
-Ma'am!
-This way.

54:01.321 --> 54:03.698
Ma'am! Ms. Yang…

54:03.782 --> 54:05.784
Hang on. I'm going to throw up…

54:07.494 --> 54:11.164
Changsik's living
a much better life than I am.

54:13.708 --> 54:15.835
Gosh, I'm aching everywhere.

54:19.089 --> 54:21.466
I might fall asleep without the meds.

54:24.678 --> 54:25.720
As if.

54:26.346 --> 54:29.015
Life isn't that easy, Ye-jin.

54:42.737 --> 54:43.738
You're still up?

54:44.656 --> 54:46.408
I couldn't sleep, so I was reading.

54:49.077 --> 54:50.328
It must be quite interesting.

54:55.750 --> 54:57.627
Do you get very sentimental at night?

54:57.711 --> 54:59.838
Have you not slept yet?
Or did you wake up?

55:00.964 --> 55:02.257
I'll go to bed soon.

55:03.216 --> 55:05.927
Let me see that. Who knows? It might help.

55:07.470 --> 55:09.305
You're not thinking

55:09.389 --> 55:11.850
of using poetry
as a sleeping pill, are you?

55:11.933 --> 55:12.892
Well,

55:12.976 --> 55:14.769
I can give it a try.

55:18.064 --> 55:20.817
You seemed to have trouble
sleeping well these days too.

55:22.027 --> 55:24.112
No, I'm sleeping very well.

55:25.030 --> 55:26.197
Really?

55:27.824 --> 55:29.367
What's your favorite poem?

55:30.326 --> 55:32.245
There aren't any marks in here.

55:32.328 --> 55:34.330
I don't like scribbling in books.

55:34.414 --> 55:35.540
Scribbling?

55:35.623 --> 55:38.793
You're recording
where you felt your emotions.

55:40.420 --> 55:43.298
I was curious to see
which lines spoke to you.

55:43.381 --> 55:44.382
Try marking them.

55:45.175 --> 55:47.135
I don't feel the need to mark anything.

55:48.136 --> 55:49.262
Okay, fine.

55:53.600 --> 55:55.185
I like the title of this.

55:55.268 --> 55:56.853
"Light Sleep."

55:57.896 --> 56:00.899
That year,
we were each other's recklessness

56:01.649 --> 56:05.945
We were the drowsiness that ate
the same meals and faced each other

56:06.529 --> 56:08.573
We were the resolution

56:08.656 --> 56:12.160
That we'd do everything
that other people did

56:12.243 --> 56:15.163
We were tapping feet

56:15.246 --> 56:17.749
Mouths that sang a song with no harmony

56:18.750 --> 56:22.921
Hope that turned to face
the still-fresh dawn

56:23.671 --> 56:25.381
And a light sleep

56:25.465 --> 56:28.802
That closed its eyes again,
forgetting it had drifted off

57:16.182 --> 57:18.101
I must be crazy!

57:18.935 --> 57:21.271
Why did I fall asleep like that?

57:23.565 --> 57:26.359
And when did I even fall asleep?

58:48.983 --> 58:52.278
Goodness, I slept so well.

58:52.362 --> 58:55.198
Nothing happened last night, right?

58:56.449 --> 58:57.408
Have some breakfast.

58:58.618 --> 58:59.702
Okay.

59:03.540 --> 59:05.500
It's pretty hot, so be careful…

59:08.253 --> 59:09.337
Isn't it hot?

59:09.420 --> 59:10.672
I'm good with hot food.

59:14.968 --> 59:17.637
There's a lab inspection today,
so I'll be back pretty late.

59:18.638 --> 59:21.099
"Pretty late"? How late is that?

59:21.182 --> 59:22.892
I'll only know once I get there.

59:23.393 --> 59:24.978
So you should have dinner on your own.

59:26.521 --> 59:27.981
Okay.

59:49.919 --> 59:51.337
I should do something.

01:00:19.574 --> 01:00:21.159
What's with this guy?

01:00:21.242 --> 01:00:22.952
Does he just clean all day or something?

01:00:24.621 --> 01:00:26.623
Is there nothing to organize?

01:00:30.627 --> 01:00:34.881
Everything's so neat and organized.

01:00:44.098 --> 01:00:45.266
Wear your socks to bed.

01:02:43.259 --> 01:02:44.677
He…

01:02:46.804 --> 01:02:48.473
really is a strange person.

01:04:13.558 --> 01:04:14.433
Did I wake you?

01:04:20.481 --> 01:04:21.732
Mr. Mechoori.

01:04:23.693 --> 01:04:24.861
What took you so long?

01:04:26.153 --> 01:04:27.738
I told you I'd be home late.

01:04:28.322 --> 01:04:30.074
Why were you sleeping here?

01:04:30.157 --> 01:04:31.200
Did you take your meds?

01:04:31.284 --> 01:04:32.660
You only took one pack, right?

01:04:32.743 --> 01:04:33.995
Did you have dinner…

01:04:55.016 --> 01:04:56.517
I missed you.

01:05:16.662 --> 01:05:19.832
SOLD OUT ON YOU

01:05:52.949 --> 01:05:54.492
What were you doing?

01:05:55.534 --> 01:05:57.286
We were going to have breakfast.

01:05:57.370 --> 01:05:58.663
Can I join you?

01:05:58.746 --> 01:06:02.416
Everything he's doing for you
is only because he feels responsible.

01:06:02.500 --> 01:06:04.293
Reinstate Ms. Dam Ye-jin.

01:06:04.377 --> 01:06:06.128
Ms. Michelle
is not going to let this slide.

01:06:06.212 --> 01:06:08.214
That's why I'm going alone.

01:06:08.297 --> 01:06:11.050
Hey, Deokpung Village 1!

01:06:11.133 --> 01:06:13.970
Today's the day we settle this.
We're having a community festival.

01:06:14.053 --> 01:06:16.806
This next game is charades.

01:06:16.889 --> 01:06:19.016
Why aren't you guessing?

01:06:19.100 --> 01:06:21.560
Hey, you fool!

01:06:22.436 --> 01:06:24.397
Sit down. We have a lot to talk about.

01:06:28.901 --> 01:06:30.903
Subtitle translation by: Juyoung Park
